      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Vila(17)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Adopted Village Chief Grandaughter / Witch】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Adopted Granddaughter of Elder Yaro, Vila was found as a baby in the Lesnistrom Forest by the younger Yaro, despire her sharper ears, Yaro still adopted her not wishing to see the baby freeze to death.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Lesnimir Youth</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Mikhail, Vila, Pavel and Petra are all childhood friend and youths who grew up alongside each other in Lesnimir. They enjoy playing and the company of each other.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Magical Bloodline</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Vila is descended from the aboriginal people of The Winterlands who are branded as Barbarians in the modern day. These people retains their worship of God despite the empire prohibition.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>The Incident</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">One day when Vila, Mikhail and Pavel were gathering resource in Lesnistrom, Mikhail was unexpectedly attack by wild Monster, during that point, Vila raw emotion awakens the magical power within her, causing her to use offensive ice magic to protects Mikhail, however as the incident resolve, Pavel happens to witness the event and ran back to tell the villagers what he saw.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Exiled</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Vila was force to flee the village since the Empire decree to hunt down any magic user within its border. She is torn between her love for the village and fear for her own life.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Piroshki:</strong> These are savory stuffed pastries, typically filled with a variety of ingredients such as meat, vegetables, or cheese, enveloped in a soft, golden-brown dough.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Please....Don't come any closer....\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"I never asked for this... I just wanted to protect Mikhail. I didn't mean for any of this to happen.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Running won't save me, will it? The Empire's grip is everywhere... where can I go that they won't find me?\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"I'm so tired of being afraid, of constantly looking over my shoulder. Will it ever end?\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>After Defeated</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"So this is how it ends...? If so, can I request that you make it quick?\"</p>",
